      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the membrane of [14] wherein the polyethylene having an Mw of less than 1 ⁇ 10 6</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is at least one of high-density polyethylene, medium-density polyethylene, branched low-density polyethylene and linear low-density polyethylene.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="p-0198">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the membrane of [16] wherein the polyethylene having an Mw of less than 1 ⁇ 10 6</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is a high-density polyethylene having an Mw in a range of about 1 ⁇ 10 5 to about 5 ⁇ 10 5 .</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="p-0198">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the membrane of [14]</span>
