        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="p-0198">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a second polyolefin</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">selected from at least one of polypropylene, polybutene-1, polypentene-1, poly-4-methylpentene-1, polyhexene-1, polyoctene-1, polyvinyl acetate, polymethyl methacrylate, polystyrene and ethylene  ⁇ -olefin copolymer.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="p-0198">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a battery</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">comprising an electrolyte, an anode, a cathode, and a separator situated between the anode and the cathode, wherein the separator comprises polyethylene, the polyethylene having a viscoelastic angular frequency  ⁇  0 of at least 0.01 rad/sec, at which a storage elastic modulus G′ and a loss elastic modulus G′′ obtained by melt rheometry are equal to each other, the separator being characterized by</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="p-0198">
      </li>
